      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Get ready for an exciting challenge! In this exciting arcade game, you
    have to become a master of knife throwing to knock down juicy fruits that appear
    on the screen. Each level offers new challenges: the speed of the fruits increases,
    and obstacles in the form of stones appear on your way, which complicate the
    task.

    - Addictive gameplay: Agility and accuracy are the key to success!
    With each level, the fruits become faster and your knife throwing skills will
    be put to a real test.

    - Variety of fruits: From bright apples to exotic
    mangoes'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: f7f4e7390d43d894bb84f136ff218a7c, type: 2}
